# Hand-written from RFC 9051 (see login_list.imap for the format)
S: * OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 UIDPLUS MOVE] IMAP4 service ready
C: a1 LOGIN "someone@example.com" "app-pass"
S: a1 OK user logged in
C: a2 EXAMINE "INBOX"
S: * FLAGS (\Answered \Flagged \Deleted \Seen \Draft)
S: * OK [PERMANENTFLAGS ()] no permanent flags permitted
S: * 3 EXISTS
S: * 0 RECENT
S: * OK [UIDVALIDITY 1700000000] UIDs valid
S: * OK [UIDNEXT 42] predicted next UID
S: a2 OK [READ-ONLY] EXAMINE completed
C: a3 UID SEARCH CHARSET UTF-8 FROM "sam@example.com" SUBJECT {5}
S: + Ready for literal data
C: Café SINCE 1-Nov-2026 UNSEEN
S: * SEARCH 9 7 8
S: a3 OK SEARCH completed
C: a4 UID FETCH 7:9 (UID FLAGS RFC822.SIZE INTERNALDATE BODY.PEEK[HEADER.FIELDS (DATE FROM TO CC SUBJECT MESSAGE-ID IN-REPLY-TO REFERENCES)])
S: * 1 FETCH (UID 7 FLAGS (\Seen) RFC822.SIZE 2048 INTERNALDATE " 3-Nov-2026 09:15:00 -0600" BODY[HEADER.FIELDS (DATE FROM TO CC SUBJECT MESSAGE-ID IN-REPLY-TO REFERENCES)] {#}
L: From: Sam <sam@example.com>
L: Subject: =?UTF-8?Q?Caf=C3=A9?=
L: Message-ID: <m1@example.com>
L:
S: )
S: * 2 FETCH (FLAGS (\Seen))
S: * 3 FETCH (UID 9 FLAGS () RFC822.SIZE 512 INTERNALDATE "14-Nov-2026 18:00:00 +0000" BODY[HEADER.FIELDS (DATE FROM TO CC SUBJECT MESSAGE-ID IN-REPLY-TO REFERENCES)] {#}
L: From: "Sam \"S\" Lee" <sam@example.com>
L: Subject: Lunch
L:
S: )
S: a4 OK FETCH completed
C: a5 UID FETCH 7 (UID RFC822.SIZE BODY.PEEK[]<0.64>)
S: * 1 FETCH (UID 7 RFC822.SIZE 2048 BODY[]<0> {#}
L: From: Sam <sam@example.com>
L: Subject: hi
L:
L: Hello there
S: )
S: a5 OK FETCH completed
C: a6 UID FETCH 8 (UID RFC822.SIZE BODY.PEEK[]<0.64>)
S: a6 OK FETCH completed
C: a7 LOGOUT
S: * BYE logging out
S: a7 OK LOGOUT completed
